      {
        "position": 1,
        "title": "Good brush.",
        "text": "Bath time with my lab used to be a whole ordeal but this brush has made it so much more manageable for both of us. The bristles work shampoo into his coat really effectively and he actually seems to enjoy the massage aspect of it, he stops squirming way sooner than he used to. The wooden handle feels solid and doesn't get slippery when your hands are wet, which is exactly what you need when you're wrestling a wet dog. It rinses clean easily after use and hasn't shown any signs of the wood warping or the bristles loosening after several washes. Simple product that does exactly what it promises and the quality feels well above what the price would suggest.",
        "rating": 5,
